==Icelandic==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈkauŋka/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|auŋka|lang=is}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|ganga|lang=non}}.

===Verb===
{{is-verb-strong|gekk|gengum|gengið}}

# {{context|intransitive|lang=is}} to [[walk]]
#: ''Hvert viltu '''ganga'''?''
#:: Where do you want to '''walk''' to?
# {{context|intransitive|of machinery|lang=is}} to [[work]], [[operate]], [[run]]
#: '''Gengur''' klukkan?
#:: ''Does the clock '''work'''?''
# {{context|intransitive|lang=is}} to [[go]] (well or badly)
#: [[hreinsun|Hreinsunin]] '''gengur''' vel.
#:: ''The cleaning is '''going''' well.''
# {{context|intransitive|lang=is}} to [[fit]], to [[go]], to be [[satisfactory]], to [[do]]
#: [[halda|Heldurðu]] að þessi kjóll '''gangi''' ekki við [[rauður|rauðu]] [[kápa|kápuna]] mína?
#:: ''Don't you think this dress will '''go''' with my red coat?''

